    "title": "Gas line puncture confirmed at 15th and Prairie - NewsBreak",
    "text": "KVOE\nwebsite\nEmporia\nGas line puncture confirmed at 15th and Prairie\nBy Chuck Samples,\n3 hours agoEmporia Fire had a busy day with three reported gas leaks Wednesday. Battalion Chief Ryan Conley says one of the three reports was confirmed as a leak — actually a line puncture. Conley says the incident at 15th and Prairie developed just after 6 pm when an IdeaTek contractor hit a gas line.\n1\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nThe KLC Journal\n·\nuser · 687 followers\nThe HD Post\n·\nuser · 21.5K followers\nDavid Heitz\n·\nuser · 29.8K followers\nThree Denver council members put homeless family in hotel, cop buys unhoused man breakfast\nDenver City Council members Serena Gonzales Guttierez, Sarah Parady and Shontel Lewis combined forces after Monday’s meeting and helped a family that had been told no shelter was available, Housekeys Action Network Denver posted Tuesday on social media.\nDenver, CO ·22d",
